<title>USA: Anadarko files $300 mln in debt, stock.</title>
<headline>Anadarko files $300 mln in debt, stock.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anadarko Petroleum Corp filed Wednesday with the Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration to sell up to $300 million in debt securities, common and preferred stock.  </p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes including refinancing outstanding debt and funding capital expenditures, the company said.</p>
<p>Anadarko, based in Houston, Texas, is an independent oil and gas exploration and production company.</p>
</text>
